# Hero: a cream spitz, after a real dog. Pale cream all over, warm apricot on
# the crown, round the ears and down the bridge of the nose; a white muzzle
# and cheeks; soft brown almond eyes; big wide-set ears, upright with rounded
# tips; a thick ruff; a plume of a tail curling up over the back; and a teal
# collar with a silver bone-shaped tag. Faces +z (z = 0 is the nose); the
# dog's left is +x; its centre is x = 11.
# Parts (for animation): body; four legs (not parented, so they stay planted
# while the body bobs); the tail and head move with the body.
size 23 31 30
voxel 0.03
smooth 3
colors
  c spitzCream
  a apricot
  d apricotDark
  w muzzleWhite
  n noseBrown
  e eyeBrown
  g white
  t collarTeal
  s silver

part body pivot 11 11 18
# A fluffy round barrel, and a full rump for the tail to spring from.
ellipsoid 11 11 18 6.6 5.6 8 c
ellipsoid 11 12.6 23.6 5.4 4.4 3.8 c
# The ruff: a thick mane round the neck, white down the front of the chest.
ellipsoid 11 14 11 8.2 7 5.6 c
ellipsoid 11 10 9.6 5.4 4.4 3.6 c
paint ellipsoid 11 11 5 5 6 4.5 w

# Stubby legs and paws, turning at the shoulder and hip. Each reaches well up
# inside the body (a shoulder, a thigh), so a swinging leg never opens a gap.
part legFrontRight pivot 7.5 8 12.5
ellipsoid 7.5 3.5 12.5 2.3 4 2.3 c
ellipsoid 7.7 9.5 12.6 2.5 3.8 2.8 c
ellipsoid 7.5 1.2 11.8 2.6 1.6 2.8 w
part legFrontLeft pivot 14.5 8 12.5
ellipsoid 14.5 3.5 12.5 2.3 4 2.3 c
ellipsoid 14.3 9.5 12.6 2.5 3.8 2.8 c
ellipsoid 14.5 1.2 11.8 2.6 1.6 2.8 w
part legBackRight pivot 7.5 8.5 23
ellipsoid 7.5 3.5 23 2.3 4 2.3 c
ellipsoid 7.7 9.5 22.6 2.7 3.8 3.2 c
ellipsoid 7.5 1.2 22.5 2.6 1.6 2.8 c
part legBackLeft pivot 14.5 8.5 23
ellipsoid 14.5 3.5 23 2.3 4 2.3 c
ellipsoid 14.3 9.5 22.6 2.7 3.8 3.2 c
ellipsoid 14.5 1.2 22.5 2.6 1.6 2.8 c

# The tail: a big plume rising off the rump well above the back line, curling
# forward over it, its tip falling to one side (the dog's left), so it reads
# in silhouette from any side. It grows out of the coat and whitens along the
# plume. Its root is buried deep in the rump, so wagging never opens a gap.
part tail pivot 11 14.5 24.5 parent body
ellipsoid 11 13.6 23.6 3 3 3.4 c
ellipsoid 11 16.5 26.2 2.9 3.4 2.8 c
ellipsoid 11 20.6 26.4 3.2 3.2 3 w
ellipsoid 11.4 23.6 23.8 3.8 3 3.6 w
ellipsoid 12.6 23 20.4 3.4 2.8 3.2 w
ellipsoid 14.2 21 18.6 2.4 2.2 2.4 w

# Head, turning at the neck. The neck reaches down into the ruff, so turning
# or tossing the head never opens a gap.
part head pivot 11 16.5 10 parent body
ellipsoid 11 15.8 11.4 4.6 4 4.2 c
# Round and broad, with fluffy cheeks.
ellipsoid 11 20.4 9.5 5.8 5 5 c
ellipsoid 6.2 18.2 9.2 2.8 2.8 3 c
ellipsoid 15.8 18.2 9.2 2.8 2.8 3 c
# Muzzle: medium and tapering, white like the cheeks.
ellipsoid 11 18.2 4.2 2.7 2.2 3.6 w
paint ellipsoid 11 16.6 5.5 5.6 3 4.2 w
# Apricot on the crown and down the bridge of the nose.
paint ellipsoid 11 25 9 6.4 3.6 6.4 a
paint ellipsoid 11 21.6 5 1.7 2.4 3 a
# Big wide-set ears: upright, leaning out a little, with rounded tips;
# apricot, deeper inside.
ellipsoid 6.9 24.8 10 2.6 2.6 1.5 a
ellipsoid 6.3 27 10 2.1 2 1.2 a
ellipsoid 5.8 28.6 10 1.5 1.3 1 a
ellipsoid 15.1 24.8 10 2.6 2.6 1.5 a
ellipsoid 15.7 27 10 2.1 2 1.2 a
ellipsoid 16.2 28.6 10 1.5 1.3 1 a
paint ellipsoid 6.6 26 8.6 1.4 2.2 0.7 d
paint ellipsoid 15.4 26 8.6 1.4 2.2 0.7 d
# Nose, and the dark line of the mouth.
ellipsoid 11 19 0.9 1.4 1.1 1 n
paint ellipsoid 11 16.8 1.5 1.6 0.35 2 n
# Eyes: soft brown almonds with a glint, set wide.
paint ellipsoid 8.3 20.9 5 1.25 1.35 3 e
paint ellipsoid 13.7 20.9 5 1.25 1.35 3 e
paint ellipsoid 7.9 21.4 5.5 0.6 0.6 4 g
paint ellipsoid 13.3 21.4 5.5 0.6 0.6 4 g

# The teal collar round the neck (painted after the white, so it shows at the
# front), and a silver bone tag hanging from it, on the body.
part body
paint ellipsoid 11 13.8 9 9 1.2 5.5 t
ellipsoid 11 12.4 4.9 0.5 0.6 0.5 s
ellipsoid 11 11.4 4.8 1.3 0.55 0.5 s
ellipsoid 9.7 11 4.8 0.6 0.6 0.5 s
ellipsoid 9.7 11.8 4.8 0.6 0.6 0.5 s
ellipsoid 12.3 11 4.8 0.6 0.6 0.5 s
ellipsoid 12.3 11.8 4.8 0.6 0.6 0.5 s
